= August Thalheimer

The party's theorist since Luxemburg's death, a Württemberg scholar with thick glasses and a sharp pen. Brandler's closest ally, he argues that communists must win the masses with concrete demands they can fight for today.

- @programme
- @transitional
- @root: Return to main

@programme
title: Clarify the Programme
subtitle: Long articles in the theoretical journal. The Right and the Spartacists find common ground.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer = 1 : Next advisor action in 1 month. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 1 : Next advisor action in [+ advisor_action_timer +] months. ?]
